/T44n1846_p0277a01","n":"0277a","t":"實者立理無以對色故有是可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0277b01","n":"0277b","t":"云何對治以唯依真如義說故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0277c01","n":"0277c","t":"離終涅槃無盡云何對治以如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0278a01","n":"0278a","t":"下返以釋成第三發趣道相中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0278b01","n":"0278b","t":"初問也分別三聚乃有多門今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0278c01","n":"0278c","t":"也十種心相及諸委曲如華嚴"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0279a01","n":"0279a","t":"勸四學他教此等並非菩薩悲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0279b01","n":"0279b","t":"為對治二以垢無量下釋修眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0279c01","n":"0279c","t":"一切眾生使無有餘皆令究竟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0280a01","n":"0280a","t":"但為初學菩薩未入正位而懈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0280b01","n":"0280b","t":"羅蜜以知法性無身心相離懈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0280c01","n":"0280c","t":"無量阿僧祇劫當成佛道以為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0281a01","n":"0281a","t":"於彼身示成菩提故在彼天也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0281b01","n":"0281b","t":"稱法性故不能決了舉非中二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0281c01","n":"0281c","t":"上文中已顯此義也鏡有垢者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0282a01","n":"0282a","t":"數列釋釋中四不壞信略說信"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0282b01","n":"0282b","t":"云何修行戒門所謂不殺不盜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0282c01","n":"0282c","t":"是故應當勇猛精勤晝夜六時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0283a01","n":"0283a","t":"二門唯一心故是故雙運方得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0283b01","n":"0283b","t":"法亦勿令手足差異正身端直"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0283c01","n":"0283c","t":"自乾耳亦常不得隨心外念境"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T44n1846_p0284a01","n":"0284a","t":"六懈怠者是放逸不勤故是六"},{"h":"https://cb